  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Pain",
   "texto": [
    "To say «It hurts.», we use **mă doare**. The name usually takes the article to the end: **Mă doare capul** («My head hurts.»)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "singular and plural",
   "texto": [
    "The verb matches the body part: **doare** with one singular (**Mă doare gâtul**) and **dor** with several (**Mă dor ochii**). We don't literally say «I have pain.»."
   ]
  },
